markdown <<MARKDOWN
# Look Through a Finished Project

This is a finished conversational AI project, the kind your students will build. Read it the way they will, by tracing each branch of the decision tree into a line of code.

**☑️ Do This:**
- In the Project Planning Guide, find the Step 3 decision tree.
- In the code, match each question in the tree to an `ask()` line.
- Run the program and answer the questions. Which lines light up as you go?

